# Build context for the embed image. Context is this directory.
#
# Same shape as `apps/admin-web/.dockerignore`, including the rule that matters most: nothing
# TypeScript compiles is excluded. `tsconfig.json` includes `**/*.ts`/`**/*.tsx` for the whole
# package and `next build` runs that check, so `tests/`, `e2e/*.browser.e2e.ts`, `config/*.test.ts`
# and the vitest/playwright configs are all in the program. Excluding `tests/` here is what
# produced `TS2307: Cannot find module '../../../../tests/support/approval-card'` on the first build —
# and excluding the specs instead would have quietly made the image's type check a smaller
# program than `pnpm typecheck`, which is a weaker gate that still reads as green.

node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets never enter a layer. Config arrives from the environment at boot, except the
# framing origin, which is a build argument — see the Dockerfile.
.env
.env.*

# Test OUTPUT, not test source.
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright-cli/

# Prose only — nothing here is in the TypeScript program.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# Docker's own files.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Editor / OS / logs.
.vscode/
.idea/
.mcp.json
*.swp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
